(THE LANTERN OF BLACKWATER COVE) Tj T*
(An introductory scenario for Call of Cthulhu / Basic Roleplaying) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Introduction) Tj T*
(In the autumn of 1925 the fishing town of Blackwater Cove, Massachusetts, is troubled by) Tj T*
(lights seen on the water at night and by the disappearance of the lighthouse keeper,) Tj T*
(Elias Thorne. The investigators are hired by his sister, Mrs. Agnes Hale.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Keeper's Information) Tj T*
(Elias Thorne discovered a drowned idol in the shoals and brought it to the lighthouse.) Tj T*
(The Sheriff, Amos Dunmore, is a member of the Lantern Society and will mislead the) Tj T*
(investigators while appearing helpful.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
