(Chapter One: Arrival in Blackwater Cove) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Scene: The Sheriff's Office) Tj T*
(Sheriff Amos Dunmore receives the investigators politely. He claims he has the only key) Tj T*
(to the lighthouse. If the investigators ask for the key, he promises to look for it and) Tj T*
(bring it to them later; he never intends to do so. A tarnished badge lies on his desk.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(NPC: Sheriff Amos Dunmore) Tj T*
(A heavy-set man of fifty. STR 70 CON 65 DEX 45 POW 60 SAN 40. Skills: Persuade 60%.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Scene: Hale Boarding House) Tj T*
(Mrs. Agnes Hale offers rooms. She gives the investigators a letter from Elias.) Tj T*
(Handout 1: Elias's Letter.) Tj T*
ET
