(Chapter Two: The Town) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Location: Blackwater Gazette Office) Tj T*
(If the investigators search the archive they find a 1911 clipping about a shipwreck and) Tj T*
(a photograph of a brass lantern recovered from the wreck.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Location: Blackwater Docks) Tj T*
(At night a mysterious figure in oilskins watches the water. He introduces himself as) Tj T*
(Jonah Pike and drops a tarnished badge with the lantern sigil when he leaves.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Item: The Lighthouse Key) Tj T*
(An iron key. The Sheriff holds it. Only if the investigators obtain the key or break in) Tj T*
(can they reach the lighthouse interior.) Tj T*
