(Chapter Three: The Lighthouse) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Condition: Entering the lighthouse requires the key, a successful Locksmith roll, or) Tj T*
(breaking the door.) Tj T*
(Scene: The Lighthouse Interior) Tj T*
(The lamp room holds the drowned idol. A trapdoor leads to the sea cave.) Tj T*
(Twist: The Sheriff's Betrayal) Tj T*
(If the investigators show the Sheriff the secret documents, he attempts to have them arrested.) Tj T*
(Ending: Dawn at the Cove) Tj T*
(If the idol is cast back into the sea, Elias is released and the lights cease.) Tj T*
